# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Sensitive / personal data — must NEVER reach any remote (incl. private) ---
# GPS-tagged RF & wardriving logs, packet/handshake captures, per-user runtime
# logs. loot/ above already covers the session dirs; these add belt-and-braces
# for anything written elsewhere in the tree.
*.csv
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.hccapx
*.22000
*.cap
